Content notice / 内容说明

This repository reconstructs and audits the computational structure of the
Tie Ban Shen Shu (铁板神数) divination system. All narrative prose, source code
and file organization are original work. Quoted verse fragments are taken from
the Qing-dynasty woodblock text 神机妙算铁版数 (c. first half of the 19th
century), which is in the public domain. No text from any modern commercial
textbook, correspondence course or paid teaching material has been reproduced.

本仓库复现并审计铁板神数的计算结构。全部叙述文字、源代码与文件组织均为原创；
所引条文诗句出自清代道光刻本《神机妙算铁版数》系统（约 19 世纪上半叶），已过版权保护期。
未复制任何现代商业教材、函授课程或收费讲义的文本。

This repository does not endorse or refute the predictive validity of the
system. It documents what the algorithm computes, and what would be required
to test whether it predicts anything.

本仓库不构成对铁板神数预测力的认可或否认，只记录该算法在算什么，
以及要检验"它是否预测了什么"需要什么样的实验。
